# Cloudflare Pages হেডার (Netlify-র netlify.toml [[headers]] এর সমান) — Private Wholesale Portal
/wholesale
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Cache-Control: no-store
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
/wholesale/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Cache-Control: no-store
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

